<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Top Glory shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Top Glory shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of property investment and food related company Top Glory International Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares ended HK$0.06 lower at HK$1.59 on Monday on volume of 19.77 million shares.</p>
<p>Top Glory, controlled by China-backed China National Cereals Oil and Foodstuffs Import and Export Corp (Ceroil), engages in property investment and food related business.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
